      "source": "The following example shows a custom style that uses bold text when the role is [`cancel`](buttonrole/cancel.md), [`red`](shapestyle/red.md) text when the role is [`destructive`](buttonrole/destructive.md), and adds no special styling otherwise:",
      "normalizedSource": "The following example shows a custom style that uses bold text when the role is [`cancel`](buttonrole/cancel.md), [`red`](shapestyle/red.md) text when the role is [`destructive`](buttonrole/destructive.md), and adds no special styling otherwise:",
